      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I usually have the Allow Untrusted URLs setting disabled. Sometimes I may have untrusted URLs enabled temporarily for one video only (which I immediately disable after the video loads), and pressing F5 to toggle Third-Person View may cause that video to unintentionally reload and display a video error due to not allowing untrusted URLs to play. Frustration follows when I have to go back to VRChat settings, open and navigate the video player UI to reload/resync a video again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-08-04T18:29:55.443Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The default F5 key to toggle Third-Person View also causes several video players to refresh/reload a video, including at [Popcorn Palace](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_266523e8-9161-40da-acd0-6bd82e075833/info) and [Illumination Media Player](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0777ec10-c871-4e2f-91cc-1c43287eb16c/info).\n\nI have no suggestion what the new hotkey should be, but it should not be F5 (refresh) or F11 (full-screen). One of the F1-F4, F6-F10 or F12 keys, or a key combination (Left Shift + ?) may be less disruptive.\n\nSimilar to: https://feedback.vrchat.com/third-person-view/p/default-keys-keybinds-feedback-pc",
